<title>PAKISTAN: Shell Pakistan net profit 316 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Shell Pakistan net profit 316 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eighteen months to June 30, 1996 vs calendar 1994 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		     26,156 vs 13,251</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     517 vs    311</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	   316 vs    195</p>
<p>    Div interim I paid    25 pct vs 25 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Div interim II paid   30 pct vs    nil</p>
<p>    Final dividend	27.5 pct vs 15 pct</p>
<p>    Bonus stocks		 nil vs 15 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Shell Pakistan Ltd. It is 51 percent owned by Royal Dutch Petroleum Co.</p>
<p>-- Karachi 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
